<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH2b1559-zh-0c8a1e15" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>成于乐 _ __乐记____声无哀乐论__选读 </title><editor role="translator">Huang Ronghua 黃榮華 and Yin Shengjuan 殷勝娟</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>成于乐 _ __乐记____声无哀乐论__选读 </title>上海：復旦大學出版社，2013</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH2b1559"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-05-13T23:58:56.731+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH2b1559-start"><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:01.164+09:00">有位秦客向东野主人发问：【从秦客的发问可知，东野主人不认同先贤们包括孔子、季札在内关于音乐有哀乐的理解，认为音乐本身并没有什么哀乐可言。这是《声无哀乐论》的总起。由这总起可知，“声无哀乐论”之“声”与“治世之音”之“音”属于同一范畴，即音乐。有人认为“声无哀乐论”所论之“声”属于普通的自然声是不对的。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:00.116+09:00">对音乐名与实的理解失实以至混乱。【①滥于名实：滥：失，乱。名，人们赋予音乐的名称，如哀乐，如善恶。实，音乐的本质。嵇康认为音乐的本质在善恶，不在哀乐。哀乐属于感情，不属于音乐。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:46.016+09:00">哪里会凭人们的爱和憎就容易被操弄，【④操：操弄。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:46:48.03+09:00">然而，‘说快乐呀快乐，⑥乐云乐云，钟鼓云乎哉：出自《论语·阳货》，前句为“礼云，礼云，玉帛云乎哉”。两句大意为：礼不只是玉帛之类的礼器，乐不只是钟鼓之类的乐器。此处引用，是说快乐不是钟鼓（音乐）表现的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.98" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T01:00:35.384+09:00">哪里还明白千差万别的感情都是自己从内心流露出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.105" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:25:16.63+09:00">来讽谏国君，⑧讽：讽喻，用含蓄委婉的语言劝告、劝谏。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.137" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:38:08.069+09:00">感叹它的音乐形式与虞舜的高尚德行的结合达到了最完美的境界，【⑨一致：最完美的境界。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.142" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:40:50.865+09:00">您就可以由此领悟到它的大部分了。”【⑩思过半：领悟到了其中的大部分。】【释义】这是主客驳难第一回合。东野主人为阐明自己的观点，主要讲了三个理由：音乐是“天地合德”的自然存在，犹如气味自然存在一样，这不会因为人心中的哀乐而发生变化；音乐可以调节人内心的哀乐，但本身不具有哀乐的特征，就像玉帛可以用于礼教，但本身不是礼教一样；同一种音乐在不同的人心中会引起不同的情感，同一种情感可以用不同的音乐来表达，可见音乐无常，所以没有不变的哀乐。为什么音乐又是“感人之最深者”？因为人的内心先有哀乐积蓄，而人又有表达哀乐的欲求，所以遇到某种与心内哀乐相契的音乐的拨动，哀乐之情就会自然地流露。嵇康在第一回合涉及了音乐的两个核心问题：一是音乐来自哪里？儒家认为音乐源于人心。《乐记·乐本篇》说：“乐者，音之所由生也，其本在人心之感于物也。”很清楚，儒家认为音乐是人心由物所触而产生的。但嵇康认为音乐源自外于人心的自然，与人心无关；音乐是“天地合德”的产物，但它也不是普通的自然之声，而是“宫商集比，声音克谐”的自然杰作。二是音乐与人的情感有怎样的关系？这其实与第一个问题紧密相关。嵇康既然认为音乐源于自然，那么音乐本身当然就没有人的情感内涵，虽然音乐可以感动人情，可以和谐人心，但仅此而已。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:13.317+09:00">“听到前人有这样的论说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:31.76+09:00">‘天下大治时音乐安适、欢乐；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:31:56.398+09:00">国家灭亡或濒临灭亡时，音乐哀戚、忧伤。’</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:12.306+09:00">天下安定还是混乱在于政治清明与否，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:24.349+09:00">而音乐就是政治清明与否的表现，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:42.85+09:00">所以人们哀戚、忧伤的情感</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:32:55.113+09:00">通过金石制作的乐器表现出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:11.963+09:00">安适、欢乐的心情</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:18.243+09:00">通过管弦乐器表现出来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:36.982+09:00">又听说仲尼欣赏《韶》乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:41.774+09:00">就能知晓虞舜的高尚德行；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:33:55.951+09:00">季札欣赏音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:00.282+09:00">就知晓了各个国家的社会风气。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:05.854+09:00">这些已经成为历史故事，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:18.929+09:00">先贤们都确信无疑。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:38.912+09:00">现在唯有您认为音乐不能表现哀乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:34:46.99+09:00">它的道理在哪里呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:35:03.309+09:00">如果您有精彩的阐述，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:35:07.633+09:00">请让我也来听一听。”</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:12.286+09:00">主人回答说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:18.311+09:00">“这其中的道理被掩埋很久了，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:27.188+09:00">没有谁愿意来阐发它，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:36:41.351+09:00">所以使得世世代代的人们</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:07.308+09:00">今天承蒙您的启发，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:15.9+09:00">我就谈谈其中的一点吧。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:30.158+09:00">“天地阴阳二气协和，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:37:44.17+09:00">万物依赖它们生长，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:12.43+09:00">寒暑交替运行，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:16.917+09:00">五行因此而生成，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:21.263+09:00">显示为五色，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:25.541+09:00">表现为五音。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:38:29.802+09:00">音乐的产生，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:02.708+09:00">就好像气味存在天地之间一样自然，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:12.631+09:00">它好听或不好听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:39:40.826+09:00">即使遭遇混乱的环境，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:28.306+09:00">本质也</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:32.556+09:00">不会发生变化，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:40:53.196+09:00">因为人们的哀和乐而改变它的律度呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:09.983+09:00">至于五音会聚，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:15.4+09:00">组成和谐的音乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:21.471+09:00">这是人们内心的最高意愿，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:37.491+09:00">情感欲望聚合的地方。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:41:44.068+09:00">古人知晓情感不能放纵，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:04.146+09:00">欲望不能获得最大满足，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:12.874+09:00">所以依据情感欲望的需要，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:18.44+09:00">时常进行节度，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:26.631+09:00">使得哀伤而不伤害身心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:42:33.868+09:00">快乐而不放纵无度；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.792+09:00">依据不同事物的属性</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.791+09:00" resp-del="#CH" src-id="CH2b1559-zh-0c8a1e15">哭泣叫做哀，歌唱叫做乐，这就是名与实统一的大致情况。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:39.793+09:00">给予不同的名号，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:43:53.067+09:00">歌唱叫做乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:44:00.476+09:00">这就是名与实统一的大致情况。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:28.122+09:00">是钟鼓在说快乐吗’？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:41.572+09:00">说哀伤呀哀伤，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:47.505+09:00">是哭泣在说哀伤吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:49:57.79+09:00">顺着这种逻辑思考，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:50:21.013+09:00">那就可以说，玉帛就不是祭礼仪式本质的东西，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:51:58.564+09:00">歌唱哭泣也不是快乐哀伤的本质。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.66" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:09.049+09:00">凭什么明白这个道理？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.67" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:15.887+09:00">不同的地方有不同的风俗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.68" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:28.893+09:00">因此歌唱或哭泣的原因就不相同。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.69" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:43.952+09:00">假如同一种音乐在不同的地方使用，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.70" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:52:51.253+09:00">就会有这样的现象：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.71" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:16.137+09:00">有人听到了在别处让人流泪的音乐他竟然高兴，有人听到了在别处让人高兴得情不自禁地唱歌的音乐他却悲伤起来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.72" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:22.106+09:00">不过他们都有悲哀或快乐的情感这点却是一致的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.73" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:31.563+09:00">现在，凭借着一样的情感</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.74" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:37.162+09:00">而发出千差万别的声音，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.75" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:53:55.174+09:00">这不是表明声音是变化莫测、无有常态的吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.76" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:32.52+09:00">“但是，声音和谐地组织成乐，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.77" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:42.158+09:00">是最感动人心的。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.78" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:54:54.72+09:00">劳作的人</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.79" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:00.995+09:00">用歌声歌咏自己的劳作，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.80" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:06.938+09:00">快乐的人用舞蹈表达自己的快乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.81" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:16.002+09:00">如果内心悲痛，就会发出哀痛的言语。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.82" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:24.771+09:00">言语组织成诗歌，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.83" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:39.862+09:00">声音组成曲调。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.84" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:47.804+09:00">大家纷纷歌咏，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.85" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:55:56.372+09:00">聚集在一起聆听，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.86" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:00.662+09:00">内心被和谐的音乐打动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.87" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:34.462+09:00">情感被悲苦的言语触动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.88" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:53.164+09:00">感叹还没有停歇，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.89" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:56:59.86+09:00">眼泪就纵横了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.90" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:04.591+09:00">悲哀的情感隐藏在内心，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.91" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:22.241+09:00">遇到和谐的音乐就被触发而流露，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.92" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:28.11+09:00">和谐的音乐没有特殊的外形，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.93" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:36.2+09:00">但是哀伤的情感却有它的主体。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.94" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:57:43.713+09:00">有主体的哀伤情感，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.95" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:58:23.436+09:00">依着没有特殊外形的和谐音乐而流露出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.96" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:58:54.206+09:00">他能感觉到的</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.97" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T00:59:43.24+09:00">只有哀伤而已，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.99" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T01:02:25.953+09:00">而不是音乐本身固有的呢？⑦吹万不同，而使自己：语出《庄子·齐物论》，大意为，风吹大地，千万洞窍发出声音，是洞窍自身发出各种声音。此处引用是想说明，声音来自自然，并借以说明听乐后出现的感情是听乐人自身的内心所发出的，并非音乐使其产生。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.100" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:24:27.542+09:00">“表现政治得失的歌谣被不断传唱，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.101" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:24:36.976+09:00">于是会促成某种社会政治。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.102" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:24:46.376+09:00">因此，国家的史官通过歌谣来认识政治教化的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.103" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:24:52.31+09:00">审视国家的盛衰，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.104" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:25:02.374+09:00">吟咏人们内心的欲求，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.106" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:25:26.675+09:00">所以说</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.107" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:26:03.092+09:00">‘国家灭亡或濒临灭亡时，音乐哀戚、忧伤’了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.108" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:26:18.543+09:00">那喜、怒、哀、乐、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.109" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:26:25.269+09:00">爱、憎、惭、惧</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.110" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:26:30.987+09:00">这八种情绪，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.111" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:28:24.714+09:00">是百姓凭借它们接触万物，传递情感的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.112" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:28:14.484+09:00">它们各有自己归属而不可混淆。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.113" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:28:00.698+09:00"/><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.114" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:28:44.165+09:00">味道应该有甘、苦来称呼。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.115" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:29:09.894+09:00">现在因为甲贤能而心里喜欢他，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.116" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:29:28.514+09:00">因为乙愚笨而情感上憎恶他，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.117" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:29:34.549+09:00">那么爱憎这样的情感应该属于我，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.118" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:30:28.83+09:00">而贤愚的品质应该属于甲乙，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.119" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:30:33.675+09:00">凭什么我喜欢这个人就称他为可爱的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.120" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:30:38.093+09:00">我憎恶这个人就称他为可憎的人呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.121" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:31:26.494+09:00">同理，凭什么我喜欢的味道就称它为可喜的滋味，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.122" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:31:33.451+09:00">我厌恶的味道就称它为可恶的滋味呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.123" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:31:42.308+09:00">根据这个道理就可以说，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.124" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:33:17.05+09:00">事物的外在称呼和内在品质</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.125" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:34:04.119+09:00">具有不同的功用，客观存在与主观称呼有差异，称呼并不能真正表现存在。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.126" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:34:08.859+09:00">音乐自然应当用好坏来区分，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.127" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:34:20.189+09:00">而与哀乐无关。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.128" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:05.312+09:00">哀乐自然是先已积蓄在内心，受到感触就流露出来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.129" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:15.318+09:00">也与音乐无关。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.130" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:29.401+09:00">音乐既没有感情的实质，也不应当有哀乐的名称，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.131" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:42.2+09:00">那么，音乐无哀乐的道理就彻底清楚了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.132" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:51.837+09:00">至于季札在鲁国</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.133" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:35:58.8+09:00">先收集诗考察礼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.134" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:36:05.074+09:00">再辨别音乐的雅俗，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.135" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:36:10.624+09:00">这难道仅仅是通过音乐本身来决断好坏吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.136" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:36:56.248+09:00">孔子欣赏《韶》，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.138" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:38:15.145+09:00">因此大加赞美，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.139" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:38:24.915+09:00">为什么一定是凭音乐明白了虞舜的高尚品德</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.140" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:38:30.819+09:00">然后发出的赞美呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-1a.141" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T03:43:42.584+09:00">现在我粗略地说明这个道理的一个方面， 【釋義 on next line continued: 嵇康的观点对不对？当然不对。说音乐源于人心，取法于自然才对。但嵇康的探索很有意义：他让人们去更深入地探索音乐的本质的同时，还启示人们以更纯粹的思维面对音乐：“季子在鲁，采诗观礼，以别风雅，岂徒任声以决臧否哉！又仲尼闻《韶》，叹其一致，是以咨嗟，何必因声以知虞舜之德，然后叹美邪？”他告诉人们，不要把一切都加给音乐！无论是以德观乐，还是以乐观德，都不可牵强。这其实就是要把音乐从政治、伦理的附庸中解救出来，使音乐成为音乐，使艺术成为艺术。尽管他的解救没有成功，但他的解救意义很大。从哲学的角度说，儒家是认识论的音乐观，嵇康则是本体论的音乐观。嵇康这种本体论的音乐观有助于人们进一步走近音乐的本质。】</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:30:29.255+09:00">秦客驳难说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:30:39.185+09:00">“您说‘天下各地的风俗各不相同，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:32:09.903+09:00">歌唱和哭泣千差万别’，但差别再大，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:32:15.233+09:00">哀乐</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:32:21.591+09:00">不可能不表现出来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:32:28.31+09:00">那情感在心中有所触动，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:32:38.934+09:00">声音便从内心流露出来。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:19.797+09:00">这种情感即使寄托在别处的音乐中，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:33.57+09:00">善于欣赏、体察的人</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:41.137+09:00">总会明白它所表达的情感，而不会有什么差错。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:45.846+09:00">从前伯牙弹琴，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:52.329+09:00">钟子期就听出了他寄托的情怀；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:33:58.057+09:00">奴隶击磬，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:34:02.629+09:00">子期就听到了他内心的哀伤；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:34:11.625+09:00">鲁国人早晨哭泣，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:34:55.468+09:00">颜渊就体察到了那种生离死别的悲苦。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:35:07.14+09:00">像以上几位，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:35:38.103+09:00">哪里还要借助固定的音调来认识，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:35:44.444+09:00">借助固定的音乐结构来验证呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:35:50.421+09:00">内心悲戚，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:17.277+09:00">感情悲苦，声音就会哀婉，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:21.989+09:00">这是非常自然的反应，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:26.642+09:00">任何人都不能逃脱的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:34.549+09:00">不过只有那极其高明的人才能识得。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:44.329+09:00">善于听音的人不会因为声音繁杂而感到听不明白，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:37:51.68+09:00">不会听音的人也不会因为声音单一而觉得容易听懂，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:38:36.826+09:00">因此就不能因为没有遇到善于听音的人</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:38:43.73+09:00">就说音乐没有可以识得的道理，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:38:52.974+09:00">见到风俗千差万别</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:38:57.236+09:00">就说音乐没有哀乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.33" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:39:35.359+09:00">“您又说，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.34" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:39:42.477+09:00">‘贤明的不应当说是可爱的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.35" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:39:47.69+09:00">愚笨的不应当说是可憎的’。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.36" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:40:50.299+09:00">但是事实却是一个人有贤能的品质，然后别人对他的喜爱之情才会产生；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.37" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:40:58.244+09:00">一个人有愚笨的特征，然后别人对他的憎恶之情才会出现，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.38" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:04.456+09:00">只不过我们不应该混淆“贤”与“爱”、“愚”与“憎”名称罢了。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.39" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:17.907+09:00">悲伤和快乐</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.40" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:22.751+09:00">也是有它们产生的原因的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.41" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:30.067+09:00">是某种音乐使我悲伤，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.42" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:35.769+09:00">是某种音乐使我快乐。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.43" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:41:44.89+09:00">假如说悲伤和快乐都是由某种音乐引起的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.44" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:42:06.612+09:00">这就更说明音乐是有实在的情感寄托的，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.45" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:42:11.004+09:00">怎么能说音乐既没有感情的实质，也不应当有哀乐的名称呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.46" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:42:39.952+09:00">“您又说：</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.47" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:42:45.615+09:00">‘季札在鲁国先收集诗考察礼，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.48" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:42:55.786+09:00">再辨别音乐的雅俗；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.49" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:02.307+09:00">孔子欣赏《韶》，感叹它的音乐形式与虞舜的高尚德行的结合达到了最完美的境界，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.50" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:12.544+09:00">因此大加赞美。’</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.51" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:17.17+09:00">这是什么话呢？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.52" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:22.327+09:00">师襄弹琴，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.53" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:27.648+09:00">孔子就领悟到了文王的风采；</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.54" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:32.043+09:00">师涓献出曲子，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.55" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:37.366+09:00">子野就听出了亡国之音，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.56" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:43:44.503+09:00">难道他们也是讲明诗意之后才做出判断、</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.57" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:44:14.947+09:00">演习礼仪之后才进行评论的吗？</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.58" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:44:30.334+09:00">这些都是聪明有独见的人，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.59" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:44:38.809+09:00">不需要像一般人那样反复听才能听出什么来，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.60" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:46:12.442+09:00">而是一听就能听出音乐的好坏、政教的得失，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.61" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:46:16.932+09:00">因此历来被传为美谈。</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.62" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:47:04.321+09:00">现在您凭那一点点浅近的知识作为标准，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.63" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:47:10.462+09:00">去评价见到的一切，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.64" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:47:19.595+09:00">恐怕是随意地否认前贤识见的精微，</seg><seg corresp="#CH2b1559_CHANT_005-2a.65" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-05-14T04:48:07.885+09:00">对夫子神明高妙体察的辜负吧？” 【这几节属于驳难的第二回合，秦客针对东野主人前述的观点展开：针对东野主人“音乐无常”说，以伯牙与钟子期、隶人与子期、鲁人与颜渊的事例，证明音乐“有常”，只是不一定就是固定不变的音调与结构；针对东野主人“名实俱去”说，以“有贤然后爱生，有愚然后憎起”类比，证明音乐有感情之实，有哀乐之名；针对东野主人说先贤、圣哲只是以德观乐或以乐观德，以师襄与孔子、师涓与子野为例，证明音乐可以观德，但有它自己的独立性。】</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>